<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Welded Sub" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A tracked sub-octave square wave is summed with the guitar before the overdrive and the British master-volume head, so both clip in the same tube stages. Palm mutes come out as one thick, grinding mass that is neither guitar nor synth. Weld sets how much synth hits the amp." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
